// Title: Potential DLL Sideloading Of MpSvc.DLL
// Rule ID: 5ba243e5-8165-4cf7-8c69-e1d3669654c1
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
